    "bindingBoundary": "reviewedCard requires exact projected sourceFact identity, including statement, release, key and parents; facts cannot acquire a familiar card by reusing only its id/key.",
    "promptScope": "System voice states that controls constrain meaning, illustrations remain possible, source conditions/modals remain local, immediate references never establish personal events and every paragraph cites complete parents. Shared voice edits supply no fixed setting."
